{"sourceUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U3QpmgZOpDwfLENXZFB9Dw?scene=1&click_id=32","status":"full","attemptedAt":"2026-11-15T16:49:34.417060+00:00","httpStatus":200,"fetchedUrl":"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U3QpmgZOpDwfLENXZFB9Dw?scene=1&click_id=32","html":"<div><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_gif/1QOpFXEQLx9smbSr1MA4OicptibISUYkHBK4UlvNGjmovGyMA3icVV4pnQ7WzDyAag9eK41FYFf2BVhIAs8CcTVQKiagm6BreQ9kqseEPicvszrQ/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span>两条重要提醒，请各位同学留意：</span></strong></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span>申请</span><strong><span>智科体验活动</span></strong><span>（QFFE/DS&amp;BA）的同学请注意：申请</span><strong><span><span>6月9日23:59</span></span></strong><span>截止。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><span>申请</span><strong><span>领创体验活动</span></strong><span>（MIF/GMiF/GMiM/DDIM）的同学：第二轮预计7月举办，报名截止至</span><strong><span><span>6月30日23:59。</span></span></strong></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>同一报名系统：</span></strong></p><p><span>https://app.fdsm.fudan.edu.cn/admission/application/upec/tyy</span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><table><tbody><tr><td><section><p><strong><span>轮次</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>举办时间</span></strong></p></section></td><td><section><p><strong><span>申请截止日期</span></strong></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>智科体验活动</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>6月28日</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>6月9日23:59</span></p></section></td></tr><tr><td><section><p><span>领创体验活动Ⅱ</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>7月</span></p></section></td><td><section><p><span>6月30日23:59</span></p></section></td></tr></tbody></table></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><strong><span><span>点击文末“阅读原文”即可申请</span></span></strong></p></section><section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section><section><section><section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmecoa.qpic.cn/sz_mmecoa_gif/ZFd8F1HXEZk80QBxaZHnyeWEd2EPDWe6ED2X5tXyribToEoof6XFqy9WqeaO1RR9fnwMich6V6JdibxdauX8dRmkrWDaXPpsBj9CZF4st6JfzE/640?wx_fmt=gif\"/></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>常见问题</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q1</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><b><span>我该如何联系到复旦管院的招生老师？</span></b></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>如在申请过程中遇到关于</span><strong><span>申请流程、材料提交或志愿修改</span></strong><span>等任何方面的疑问，都可以通过</span><strong><span><span>upec@fudan.edu.cn</span></span></strong><span> 与我们联系。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q2</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>参加智科体验活动以及数学编程评估的形式是线上还是线下？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>都可以，同学可以根据实际情况选择</span><strong><span><span>线上或线下</span></span></strong><span>参加体验活动。为了更好的交流体验，我们欢迎大家选择线下参与。如选择参加线下体验活动，则默认于线下参加数学编程评估。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q3</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>体验活动中的数学编程评估范围是什么？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><strong><span><span>数学评估范围（概率论与数理统计）</span></span></strong><span><br/></span></p><p><span>a.微积分(函数、极限、连续、一元函数微积分学、多元函数微积分学、无穷级数);</span></p><p><span>b.线性代数(行列式、矩阵、向量、线性空间、线性方程组、矩阵的特征值和特征向量、二次型);</span></p><p><span>c.概率论与数理统计(随机事件和概率、随机变量及其概率分布、二维随机变量及其概率分布、随机变量的数字特征、大数定律和中心极限定理、数理统计的基本概念、参数估计、假设检验，回归分析)。</span></p><p><span><br/></span></p><p><strong><span>Python评估范围</span></strong></p><p><span>a. 熟练掌握Python语言实现基础数据结构（列表、元组、字典、集合）,控制流（选择、循环）,函数定义和参数传递；</span></p><p><span>b. 能够实现数据从服务器端到分析软件的预处理、基本分析和可视化过程；</span></p><p><span>c. 熟悉算法复杂度的基本概念、常见算法的复杂度、面向对象开发、经典机器学习（分类、回归、聚类）和深度学习（多层感知机、卷积神经网络、循环神经网络、注意力机制）算法等领域的基本知识；</span></p><p><span>d. 了解开源大模型应用和智能体开发等领域的操作步骤。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q4</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请体验活动时需提供前五学期还是前六学期的成绩证明？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>现阶段申请时，申请人仅需提供前五学期的成绩证明即可，待第六学期成绩公布后，须及时通过</span><strong><span>系统/邮件</span></strong><span>等方式完成补充提交。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q5</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>若所在学院无法开具排名证明，或成绩单无法加盖教务部门公章，应如何处理？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>任何特殊情况，</span><strong><span>均可以通过邮件联系我院</span></strong><span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q6</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>申请提交后可以更新信息和材料吗？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>可以，我院欢迎同学们随时更新自己的材料，通过邮件形式更新即可</span><strong><span><span>（需附上报名号、姓名及相关证明材料），切忌直接在系统中点击“终止申请”。</span></span></strong></p></section></section></section></section></section><section><section><section><section><section><p><strong><span>Q7</span><span><br/></span></strong></p></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>如因期末考试或其他重要事项冲突无法参加体验活动怎么办？</span></strong></p></section></section></section><section><section></section></section><section><section><section><p><span>请邮件招生组并提交相关证明，招生组将于后期安排其他体验机会。</span><span><br/></span></p></section></section></section></section></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><p><span><a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U3QpmgZOpDwfLENXZFB9Dw?scene=1&amp;click_id=32\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#复旦管院</a>  <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U3QpmgZOpDwfLENXZFB9Dw?scene=1&amp;click_id=32\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#领创体验活动</a>  <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U3QpmgZOpDwfLENXZFB9Dw?scene=1&amp;click_id=32\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#智科体验活动</a>  <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U3QpmgZOpDwfLENXZFB9Dw?scene=1&amp;click_id=32\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#保研</a> <a href=\"https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s/U3QpmgZOpDwfLENXZFB9Dw?scene=1&amp;click_id=32\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">#招生</a></span></p></section><p><span><br/></span></p><section><section><section><section><section><section><img loading=\"lazy\" referrerpolicy=\"no-referrer\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/sz_mmbiz_jpg/zTVRVjfBSQaDWhwxohFVnufQWibFIDzBZFHYxdXTGicNTNkREyiarL7M4XfyicZg4CrpHNn5AypDYs2Jib7nPTaD8tk0NRz3ic1s1aCc0z6Pcmads/640?wx_fmt=jpeg\"/></section></section></section><section><section><p><strong><span>复旦大学管理学院</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>本硕博教育中心</span></strong></p></section><section><section><p><span>电话：021-25011564、25011497</span></p><p><span>邮箱：upec@fudan.edu.cn</span></p></section></section></section></section></section></section></section><p></p></div>","textSha256":"f4ef0c68b2a26a3b3e6381dca972521786d8b83c0f2c4a761b335db35cb33043","textLength":1234,"sourceSha256":"187b37749f80bac5db5c94bbf0125360f8a28ebc26889d5944b09178dd090281","selector":"#js_content","attachments":[],"pdfs":[],"unavailabl